# M15 "Avlaklar", flow "m15_unique" (Ortaocak, EnterLevel = 20, MonsterAttack = 40, ForceUnique, BossRespawnMs:
# the server's testing hooks, docs/PROTOCOL_LEVELS.md §5), run at 1280x720 (m15_unique_1920.voscript: the same
# at 1920x1080): a new warrior enters at level 20 (the experience tooltip says the cap), walks into Kül Çukuru 1
# (the slot's name line under the zone name), kills the boss Kor Bekçisi ("Boss" on the target frame and the
# label), opens its loot (one of its unique items for sure: amber name), takes everything and shows the unique
# item's tooltip ("Eşsiz", "Satılamaz").
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m15_unique_a
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Essizci
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown 1800
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 600
expect world+level20+safezone
# The experience bar at the cap.
move 640 699
wait 3
expecttext hud.tooltip Deneyim (Seviye 20)
expecttext hud.tooltip En yüksek seviyedesin.
scene camera behind 25 8
wait 3
screenshot 01_level20_hud.png
# Into Kül Çukuru 1: its name line under the zone name.
scene walkpath 221.6 289.6
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
expect world+slot+slot_esik_kul_1+outsidesafe
expecttext world.slotname Kül Çukuru 1 · Sv. 1-2
wait 3
screenshot 02_slot_line.png
# The boss Kor Bekçisi on the plateau's north-west edge.
scene walkpath 214 326
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Kor Bekçisi 7
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Kor Bekçisi
key f
waitfor world+attacking+incombat 900
wait 20
scene camera behind 26 8
wait 4
screenshot 03_boss_fight.png
waitfor world+kills1 4000
expect world+alive
waitfor world+lootvisible+lootmine 300
key e
waitfor world+lootwin+lootcontents 600
wait 10
screenshot 04_boss_loot_unique.png
key e
waitfor world+lootidle 600
waitfor world+lootwinclosed 600
scene movestack unique 6
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
key i
waitfor world+inv 60
hoveron inv.bag.6
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Eşsiz
expecttext inv.tooltip Satılamaz
expecttext inv.tooltip Gereken seviye: 6
screenshot 05_unique_tooltip.png
quit
